   "html": "<div class=\"two-col\">\n<div class=\"prose\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Write to us</div>\n<h2>Partners, researchers, media, diaspora</h2>\n<p>Use this form to reach the association’s facilitation team in English or French. We answer every message. Institutions and development partners who wish to respond to an advocacy brief, journalists, researchers working on the Sara peoples, and members of the diaspora who want to join or contribute are all welcome.</p>\n<p>Facilitator: Bignéro Moïalbéi LE MADANG. Official contact number: <a aria-label=\"Call the association\" class=\"lien-appel\" href=\"tel:+23566299403\" title=\"Call the association\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path></svg><span>call</span></a> (Adoumbé Maoura, president), also on <a href=\"https://wa.me/23566299403\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a>. No e-mail yet: the domain name lonodji.org has been live since 27 September 2026, but no e-mail address is attached to it yet. We will publish addresses here as soon as they work; until then, this form and WhatsApp are the two reliable ways to reach us. The association does not collect dues or donations for now: it will do so only once its authorisation is confirmed and an account is open in its name, so please send no money to anyone on its behalf. Social media accounts will be published as soon as they are opened.</p>\n</div>\n<form action=\"/__forms.html\" id=\"formulaire-en\" method=\"POST\" name=\"message-en\"><p class=\"form-requis\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\">*</span> are required.</p><input name=\"form-name\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"message-en\"/>\n<input autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"_honey\" style=\"display:none\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\"/>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"e-name\">Full name<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\"> *</span></label><input autocomplete=\"name\" id=\"e-name\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"e-org\">Organisation (optional)</label><input id=\"e-org\" name=\"organisation\" type=\"text\"/></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"e-mail\">E-mail<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\"> *</span></label><input autocomplete=\"email\" id=\"e-mail\" name=\"email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"e-subj\">Subject<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\"> *</span></label><select id=\"e-subj\" name=\"subject\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Choose</option><option>Reply to an advocacy brief</option><option>Partnership / funding</option><option>Research / media</option><option>Join the association</option><option>Other</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"e-msg\">Message<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\"> *</span></label><textarea id=\"e-msg\" name=\"message\" required=\"\" rows=\"6\"></textarea></div>\n<label class=\"check check--consentement\"><input name=\"consentement\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"oui\"/> <span>I agree that ADEB LONODJI keeps this information to follow up on my message, stored with its host in the United States (Netlify). <a href=\"/mentions-legales#donnees\">Data and rights <span>(in French)</span></a><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"requis\"> *</span></span></label>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n</form>\n</div>"
  }
